            "review_title": "Review at Protein Kitchen",
            "review_text": "kaci le\n2 contributions\n0\nOne of my favourite restaurant in Ho Chi Minh city.Very healthy !\nOct 2020\nim in love with this place.This restaurant is a great place for keto eaters, vegetarians, and gym enthusiasts. Good location near Vivo mall, spacious space with lively music, enthusiastic service staff, especially the Italian boss is very friendly and if you have questions about how to eat to improve health, you will receive useful advice, come and enjoy the food here, especially the pancake made by the boss himself, it's delicious!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
